{"4709150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeons of Shalnor: The New Age", "steam_appid": 4709150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger looms over the southeastern province of Mediterra. Explore the vast regions, towns, and dungeons. Fight against beasts, bandits, undead, and other terrifying creatures all while helping the desperate people of the continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709150/extras/73b7768d8df6ba3f7b53cf21a8edaf14.avif?t=1784962385\" width=800 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709150/extras/704e74432614b5b9b6cc50408359a7a3.webp?t=1784962385\" width=480 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a simple and intuitive character creator. Choose your Race, Gender, and Class, and spend your skill points wisely... and carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Race and Class comes with its own unique set of skills, but how you build your character further is entirely up to you. You can choose to play as a Knight who specializes in Fire magic, or as a Mage who equips heavy armor and wields a large hammer, or perhaps even a noble and righteous Templar who has mastered Lockpicking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides combat skills, you can also learn professions such as Mercantile, Alchemy and Maintenance. Each skill improves one aspect of your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709150/extras/266ea726f62987efc8ec7c663e46a2a8.avif?t=1784962385\" width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709150/extras/37f90b05bb89851dc85d20d8ad0f86b4.webp?t=1784962385\" width=480 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons with elemental enchantments, deadly spells that pierce through a squad of monsters, traps that can be laid before a boss encounter, and Divine magic buffs that enhance your combat prowess. Each approach has its own rewards, and multiple options are available for each style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As for weapons and armor, you will not be easily rewarded. To find the best equipment, a certain amount of dedication is expected. Four levels of rarity exist for items: Common, Uncommon, Rare, and Epic. And finding an Epic item will cost you an arm and a leg. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709150/extras/4d34391a1c5faeacc46bfc3737aa9eaf.webp?t=1784962385\" width=480 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gorgon Queen has come to Mediterra. Her presence in the continent is unprecedented, and her ambitions are unknown. But the queen is not the only one causing trouble, speak to the residents of the land, and you will find many threats lurking in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709150/extras/eba693f60fc238dec53132573749870b.avif?t=1784962385\" width=800 height=376 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Shalnor has an intricate and rich lore, and while you explore the many regions of the world, you will hear its story through quests, books, notes, and folk tales. The new age is an age of heroes, and soon you shall become one of them.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger looms over the southeastern province of Mediterra. Explore the vast regions, towns, and dungeons. Fight against beasts, bandits, undead, and other terrifying creatures all while helping the desperate people of the continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709150/extras/73b7768d8df6ba3f7b53cf21a8edaf14.avif?t=1784962385\" width=800 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709150/extras/704e74432614b5b9b6cc50408359a7a3.webp?t=1784962385\" width=480 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a simple and intuitive character creator. Choose your Race, Gender, and Class, and spend your skill points wisely... and carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Race and Class comes with its own unique set of skills, but how you build your character further is entirely up to you. You can choose to play as a Knight who specializes in Fire magic, or as a Mage who equips heavy armor and wields a large hammer, or perhaps even a noble and righteous Templar who has mastered Lockpicking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides combat skills, you can also learn professions such as Mercantile, Alchemy and Maintenance. Each skill improves one aspect of your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709150/extras/266ea726f62987efc8ec7c663e46a2a8.avif?t=1784962385\" width=800 height=532 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709150/extras/37f90b05bb89851dc85d20d8ad0f86b4.webp?t=1784962385\" width=480 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons with elemental enchantments, deadly spells that pierce through a squad of monsters, traps that can be laid before a boss encounter, and Divine magic buffs that enhance your combat prowess. Each approach has its own rewards, and multiple options are available for each style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As for weapons and armor, you will not be easily rewarded. To find the best equipment, a certain amount of dedication is expected. Four levels of rarity exist for items: Common, Uncommon, Rare, and Epic. And finding an Epic item will cost you an arm and a leg. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709150/extras/4d34391a1c5faeacc46bfc3737aa9eaf.webp?t=1784962385\" width=480 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gorgon Queen has come to Mediterra. Her presence in the continent is unprecedented, and her ambitions are unknown. But the queen is not the only one causing trouble, speak to the residents of the land, and you will find many threats lurking in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709150/extras/eba693f60fc238dec53132573749870b.avif?t=1784962385\" width=800 height=376 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Shalnor has an intricate and rich lore, and while you explore the many regions of the world, you will hear its story through quests, books, notes, and folk tales. The new age is an age of heroes, and soon you shall become one of them.</p>", "short_description": "An old-school first-person dark fantasy CRPG. Create your own character with a unique set of skills. Explore the world and delve into perilous dungeons, equip yourself with powerful weapons and armor, and unravel the deceptive schemes of the Gorgon Queen.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709150/aec4f2eead3676f8b01e4267cebce56dc4bec4f1/header.jpg?t=1784962385", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709150/34ba990bcab2a5a1c90213d500b4833829d8f84a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784962385", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4709150/34ba990bcab2a5a1c90213d500b4833829d8f84a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784962385", "website": "https://ostadgames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 460 | Radeon R7 350<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li>